WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.500
Emisa foreimi letswapong mme o tshwaye moo kgwele e tshelang thupa teng.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:16.500
Fetola foreimi e le hore maoto a fapanye dibaka hantle dibakeng tseo tse pedi tse tshwanang, mme o tshwaye hape.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:22.667
Level mark (letshwao la ho lekalekana) le bohareng pakeng tsa matshwao ao a mabedi.

00:00:22.667 --> 00:00:32.417
Sutisa leoto le leng ho nyolosa kapa ho theosa letswapo ho fihlela kgwele e fanyeha hodima level mark.
